  "exceptions": [
    "Magic UI Highlighter is represented by a Custom native mark alternative; the upstream rough-notation animation dependency is not introduced.",
    "shadcn Marker is a section/group marker, not an inline word highlight. Its genuine source is used with that corrected meaning.",
    "Neutral initials and illustrative guide material demonstrate content-dependent options; they do not establish real officers, approved documents or a production enquiry service.",
    "The portable HTML remains self-contained and therefore inlines the asynchronous Motion feature module. The modular production build keeps its feature chunk separate; no portable payload reduction is claimed."
  ]
